div.p:
The credit of $326,000 appropriated by the law of the 14th of January of the
                    current year being exhausted, which provided for the cleaning of the streets and
                    for the work of sanitation of Santiago de Cuba, Cienfuegos, Matanzas, Cardenas,
                    Nuevitas, Trinidad, Caibarien, Isabela de Sagua, Batabano, Camaguey, Santa
                    Clara, Guines, Pinar del Rio, and Guanajay;
